== Faction tips ==
Went from Apprehensive to Warmly with Priests of Life within 9 total turn-ins.

Unable to initiate quest with Erudite Paladin (Prexus) at Apprehensive or low Indifferent.

Unable to get note for the 1st step, but was able to turn in both rib and pouch at dubious.

Using Skeleton form (nec call of bones) I was able to go from scowls to dubious as a dark elf and turn in bone and pouch. 

